# myPENS — caricature logo is sacred

**Do not replace Jerome’s drinking Indian / Native American PENS caricature logo without his explicit ask.**

Canonical assets (launcher + in-app `PensLogo`):

- `mypens-mobile/assets/images/icon.png`
- `mypens-mobile/assets/images/adaptive-icon.png`

